text = "This game is heavily inspired by the Impossible Quiz. Basically try to beat 
the quiz by answering all of the questions. However, this game has similar 
hard questions to the original game. It requires insane logic and guessing. 
\"It's hard, but it's NOT impossible.\"

You will have 3 lives throughout the quiz. If you lose all of them it's game
over for you.

There are some mechanics similar to the original game, press more to find 
out!"

